# Archive

Stale memory entries and retired rules land here, with the date and reason. Nothing is deleted. This keeps `MEMORY.md` and `CLAUDE.md` under their ceilings without losing history.

Format:

```
## YYYY-MM-DD — <what moved>
Reason: <why it was archived>
<the archived content>
```

